include system.settings
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes
thermo_style custom step temp press pe ke etotal vol density lx ly lz
thermo 2000
reset_timestep 0
velocity all create 366.0 4928459 mom yes rot no dist gaussian
timestep 0.5
fix md all nvt temp 366.0 366.0 100.0
run 40000
unfix md
fix md all npt temp 366.0 366.0 100.0 z 0.0 0.0 1000.0
run 200000
write_data final.data
